","url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityDragPoint(_:description:isEnabled:)-3fcbp":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilitydragpoint(_:description:isenabled:)-3fcbp","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityDragPoint(_:description:isEnabled:)-3fcbp","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"accessibilityDragPoint(_:description:isEnabled:)","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibilityDragPoint"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI9UnitPointV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UnitPoint"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"description"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Text"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"isEnabled"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"